<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Connect Workspace</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--fg:#1d1d1f;--muted:#5f6368;--bg:#fff;--card:#f5f5f7;--line:#d2d2d7}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--fg:#f5f5f7;--muted:#a1a1a6;--bg:#111;--card:#1c1c1e;--line:#3a3a3c}}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
main{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px}
a{color:inherit}h1{font-size:1.6rem;margin:0 0 4px}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:28px 0 8px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
pre{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}
ul{padding-left:20px}.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0}
</style></head><body><main><h1>Connect Workspace to your AI client</h1>
<p class="muted">Workspace is an MCP server at</p><pre>http://127.0.0.1:3333/mcp</pre>
<p>Every client signs in with your account (OAuth). Clients that can send a header may use an API key instead, always in a header, never in the address.</p><h2>Chat apps</h2><ul><li><a href="/install/claude">Claude (web &amp; desktop)</a></li><li><a href="/install/chatgpt">ChatGPT</a></li></ul><h2>Coding agents</h2><ul><li><a href="/install/claude-code">Claude Code</a></li><li><a href="/install/codex">Codex CLI</a></li><li><a href="/install/copilot">GitHub Copilot CLI</a></li><li><a href="/install/cursor">Cursor</a></li><li><a href="/install/opencode">OpenCode</a></li><li><a href="/install/antigravity">Antigravity</a></li><li><a href="/install/gemini-cli">Gemini CLI</a></li><li><a href="/install/cline">Cline</a></li><li><a href="/install/kilo">Kilo Code</a></li><li><a href="/install/amp">Amp</a></li><li><a href="/install/droid">Factory droid</a></li><li><a href="/install/qwen-code">Qwen Code</a></li><li><a href="/install/pi">Pi</a></li></ul><h2>Editors</h2><ul><li><a href="/install/vscode">VS Code (Copilot Chat)</a></li><li><a href="/install/windsurf">Windsurf</a></li><li><a href="/install/zed">Zed</a></li></ul></main></body></html>

